      "message": "\u003e But it would be better if we changed the lint invocation of libcore/* such that NewApi was not an error,  at which point the baseline can be deleted and won\u0027t have to be continuously updated ...\n\n+ccross Do you have any thoughts on this? I have not fully scoped this out yet, but can this be done if `--disable NewApi` is passed to the [lint invocation](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/java/lint.go;l\u003d423-451;drc\u003dmaster;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0) of libcore/*?  \n\nI also noticed that LintProperties has a [Disabled_Checks](https://cs.android.com/android/_/android/platform/build/soong/+/6b76c15b9a03952e122522279fc0ada4e7a8fbbd:java/lint.go;l\u003d53;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0) field. It is only used in `lint_project_xml` now, could it be used in `lint` invocation as well?",
